      "actions": "free",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Requirements The Chelaxian mage's last action was to cast a non-cantrip spell\n\n---\nEffect The Chelaxian mage siphons devilish energy drawn from pacts with a vordine devil into their trident. Until the end of the turn, the weapon deals an extra 2d6 fire damage, gains the unholy trait, and gains the effects of a returning rune."
