    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Devil Summoning",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "The Chelaxian mage can cast a 5th-rank Summon Fiend arcane spell to summon a Vordine devil. To do so, they must sacrifice three 3rd-rank prepared spells and voluntarily take 4d12 fire damage that can't be reduced or prevented. If the Chelaxian mage is unable to Sustain the Spell, including if they're knocked out or killed, the spell continues, but the GM rolls a DC 10 Flat check each round, ending the spell on a failure; regardless of whether the spell continues or not, the vordine devil attacks whatever creature is closest to it indiscriminately. If the Chelaxian mage dies, the devil disappears."
